# 8️⃣ Find Largest Element That Occurs Exactly Once

### Array

```java
int[] arr = {4, 7, 2, 7, 9, 4, 6};
```

Unique elements:

```text
2, 9, 6
```

Largest unique = `9`

### Code

```java
int[] arr = {4, 7, 2, 7, 9, 4, 6};

int largest = Integer.MIN_VALUE;

for(int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {

    int count = 0;

    for(int j = 0; j < arr.length; j++) {
        if(arr[i] == arr[j]) {
            count++;
        }
    }

    if(count == 1 && arr[i] > largest) {
        largest = arr[i];
    }
}

System.out.println("Largest Unique = " + largest);
```

### Output

```text
Largest Unique = 9
```

### 🧠 Important

```java
count == 1
```

means:

> This element occurs exactly once.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

